Farai and Thandeka run a poultry project near Chinhoyi. Their profit for the year ended 31 December 2025 was US\$28,460.

|  | Farai US\$ | Thandeka US\$ |
| --- | ---: | ---: |
| Capital (unchanged all year) | 36,000 | 18,000 |
| Drawings | 5,400 | 3,300 |

The partnership agreement provides:

1. interest on capital at 5% a year;
2. interest on drawings at 10% a year (Farai drew on 1 July 2025 and Thandeka on 1 May 2025);
3. a salary of US\$6,600 a year for Thandeka;
4. the remaining profit shared Farai 3 : Thandeka 2.
